        "says": "setAccessible(true) on a member of a named module's package that is not opened to the caller throws InaccessibleObjectException.",
        "basis": [
          "section:Common Pitfalls and How to Avoid Them"
        ],
        "exercise": "quiz",
        "reason": null
      },
      {
        "id": "pattern-matching",
        "says": "Pattern matching for instanceof is preferred over reflective type checks when the type is known at compile time.",
        "basis": [
          "section:Relevant Java 21 Features"
